<title>AUSTRALIA: Alcaston Mining in diamond joint venture.</title>
<headline>Alcaston Mining in diamond joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Alcaston Mining NL said on Monday it would form a joint venture with Canada's Poplar Resources Ltd for evaluation and exploration of diamonds in Sweden.</p>
<p>&quot;Both companies will contribute equally to the joint venture following the setting up of office, laboratory and storage facilities to permit an imminent till and stream sampling programme within already identified target areas in Sweden,&quot; Alcaston said.</p>
<p>It gave no financial details.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
